hsbc-revolution.l4:1750:1-198:
  `Rate answer` OF 1, 0.4, Unconfirmed, 0.4, 4, 0.4, TRUE, FALSE, (Cap OF "Revolution contactless + online (one pool)", TRUE, 1000, `Calendar month`, `By posting date`), (LIST "the rate turns on a fact only the merchant's acquirer knows: cl.6 says HSBC decides this \"based on system indicators which are determined by the merchants and the merchant's acquiring bank\"", "if this merchant flags the payment as an online transaction it is an Eligible Transaction; if it flags card-present it is not, and earns the base rate", "the indicator is stable per merchant, so one test purchase settles it for every future purchase there", "0.4 miles per HSBC Reward point is the market conversion, not a figure from a held document: cl.13 puts the conversion in the HSBC Rewards Programme terms, which are not in this bundle"), (LIST Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "6", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "“Selected Online Transactions” refers to Qualifying Transactions made via the internet and processed by the respective merchants/merchant’s acquiring bank as an online transaction type through the Visa Worldwide networks, including credential-on-file payments when the Cardholder stores the Card information with a merchant or payment facilitator to make future purchases. HSBC determines whether a transaction is a Selected Online Transaction based on system indicators which are determined by the merchants and the merchant’s acquiring bank.", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "7", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "“Eligible Transactions” refers to Selected Contactless Payments and Selected Online Transactions that fall within any one of the following MCCs:", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "7.1", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "(i) 1 Reward point (“Base Points”) for every SGD1 of the Eligible Transaction; and (ii) (a) 9 Reward points (“Bonus Points”) for every SGD1 of the Eligible Transaction; or (b) 19 Bonus Points for every SGD1 of the Eligible Transaction if the Cardholder maintains a Deposits ADB of at least SGD50,000 in the Eligible EGA Account for the calendar month in which the Eligible Transaction was posted.", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "7.2", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "Reward points shall be calculated based on the total amount of Eligible Transactions posted into HSBC’s credit card system within each qualifying calendar month, rounded down to the nearest SGD1. Bonus Points are subject to a cap of: (i) 9,000 Bonus Points per calendar month; or (ii) 22,800 Bonus Points per calendar month if the Cardholder maintains a Deposits ADB of at least SGD50,000 in the Eligible EGA Account with HSBC for that calendar month. Base Points are not subject to any cap."), Verified
hsbc-revolution.l4:1751:1-180:
  `Rate answer` OF 20, 0.4, Unconfirmed, 8, 8, 8, FALSE, TRUE, (Cap OF "Revolution contactless + online (one pool)", TRUE, 1200, `Calendar month`, `By posting date`), (LIST "a contactless tap at an MCC in the cl.7 table, at the higher bonus rate: 20 Reward points per SGD1, Bonus Points capped at 22,800 a calendar month (about S$1,200 of eligible spend)", "HSBC's own FAQ still says contactless payments earn 1 Reward point with effect from 15 July 2024; the T&C effective 1 April 2026 makes a contactless tap an Eligible Transaction at cl.5 and cl.7, and is the later instrument", "0.4 miles per HSBC Reward point is the market conversion, not a figure from a held document: cl.13 puts the conversion in the HSBC Rewards Programme terms, which are not in this bundle"), (LIST Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "5", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "“Selected Contactless Payments” refers to Qualifying Transactions made via Visa contactless through a contactless terminal mode which includes Visa payWave, Apple Pay, Google Pay and Samsung Pay.", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "6", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "“Selected Online Transactions” refers to Qualifying Transactions made via the internet and processed by the respective merchants/merchant’s acquiring bank as an online transaction type through the Visa Worldwide networks, including credential-on-file payments when the Cardholder stores the Card information with a merchant or payment facilitator to make future purchases. HSBC determines whether a transaction is a Selected Online Transaction based on system indicators which are determined by the merchants and the merchant’s acquiring bank.", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "7", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "“Eligible Transactions” refers to Selected Contactless Payments and Selected Online Transactions that fall within any one of the following MCCs:", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "7.1", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "(i) 1 Reward point (“Base Points”) for every SGD1 of the Eligible Transaction; and (ii) (a) 9 Reward points (“Bonus Points”) for every SGD1 of the Eligible Transaction; or (b) 19 Bonus Points for every SGD1 of the Eligible Transaction if the Cardholder maintains a Deposits ADB of at least SGD50,000 in the Eligible EGA Account for the calendar month in which the Eligible Transaction was posted.", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "7.2", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "Reward points shall be calculated based on the total amount of Eligible Transactions posted into HSBC’s credit card system within each qualifying calendar month, rounded down to the nearest SGD1. Bonus Points are subject to a cap of: (i) 9,000 Bonus Points per calendar month; or (ii) 22,800 Bonus Points per calendar month if the Cardholder maintains a Deposits ADB of at least SGD50,000 in the Eligible EGA Account with HSBC for that calendar month. Base Points are not subject to any cap.", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "9", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "For avoidance of doubt, the maximum total Reward points that may be awarded for every SGD1 of an Eligible Transaction is 20 Reward points", Provenance OF "hsbc-revolution-reward-points-tnc", "10", "Effective from 1 April 2026", (DATE OF 1, 4, 2026), "the Base Points will be computed and credited into the Account based on the Cardholder’s statement cycle. The Bonus Points will be credited into the Account by the last day of the following calendar month"), Verified
